{
  "work_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1",
  "source_path": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1.json",
  "source_language": "cop",
  "target_language": "eng",
  "provenance": {
    "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12": {
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
      "prompt_version": "bulk-2026-10-12",
      "date": "2026-10-12",
      "script": "scripts.embed_eval.translate"
    },
    "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14": {
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
      "prompt_version": "bulk-2026-10-12",
      "date": "2026-10-14",
      "script": "__main__"
    }
  },
  "translations": [
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.000.0000",
      "source_sha256": "40f860b92881d72a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And again: “All my days have wasted away in shame.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.000.0001",
      "source_sha256": "53c4062d2348b881",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Again: “But you despised him; you rejected your anointed one; you abandoned him, Lord.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.000.0002",
      "source_sha256": "d428d0d57f61f1a9",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And: “You poured shame down upon him.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.000.0003",
      "source_sha256": "0b8071a228207ad1",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 12,
      "text": "And again: “I was an object of reproach among men and of contempt among the people.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.000.0004",
      "source_sha256": "6c6ad7d7ceb982d0",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 12,
      "text": "“Everyone who sees me mocks me. They speak with their lips and shake their heads.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.000.0005",
      "source_sha256": "0ddfe14a3d5dac1d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 12,
      "text": "And again: “Those who sit at the gates spoke against me, and those who drink wine sang songs about me.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.000.0006",
      "source_sha256": "4151ce1be6dba3ec",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 12,
      "text": "And: “Because of you I have borne reproach; shame has covered my face.” And again: “I encountered affliction and distress, and I cried out to the Lord.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.000.0007",
      "source_sha256": "11cbcb40ad036f18",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 12,
      "text": "And again: “Do not be silent, God, and do not remain still. Look, your enemies have cried out, and those who hate me have raised their heads.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.000.0008",
      "source_sha256": "a87e749aea036449",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“My God, do not remain silent at my praise, for the mouth of the sinner and the deceitful [?] against me.” Again: “You sheltered me under the shade of your wings, in the presence of the ungodly who afflicted me.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.000.0009",
      "source_sha256": "c43cf3fa4a017eaf",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And again: “You brought me out of my troubles, and I saw that my enemies had been destroyed.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.000.0010",
      "source_sha256": "088fe7c4d1ab0e28",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And again: “They cast me out, the beloved one, like a loathed dead man.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.000.0011",
      "source_sha256": "3a16200743a62092",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And again: “They confronted me on the day of my suffering.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.000.0012",
      "source_sha256": "e947c9f3032db397",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And again: “They gave me bitterness to drink; he made me experience gall.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.000.0013",
      "source_sha256": "b8624970eb3dcfe1",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And again: “You brought us into the trap; you placed afflictions before us.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.000.0014",
      "source_sha256": "aaea9029cae6bfb1",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The testimony of their love for the Lord and his law is that they do not turn away from him amid their hardships and afflictions."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.000.0015",
      "source_sha256": "e5c490a7d77f05cd",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "As he said: “All these things came upon us, but we did not forget you.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.000.0016",
      "source_sha256": "cc24ef56d47d0c24",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And: “The ropes of sinners entangled me, but I did not forget your law.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.000.0017",
      "source_sha256": "50cac66588f9437b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For we, at this present time, boast of human glory and honor,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.000.0018",
      "source_sha256": "d05568e93851f132",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "but the prophets themselves, the apostles, and all the righteous boast"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.001.0000",
      "source_sha256": "45ecedef65fced84",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Drown them. Or if there is no authority."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.001.0001",
      "source_sha256": "972a1a2e94eb6fba",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For just as the fighter runs—does the one who wages war not run?—the soldier himself runs all the more. Or has he not come out to the battlefield?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.001.0002",
      "source_sha256": "6c7606416ce009d0",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Or if the fighter concerns himself with his own affairs, where will he find [?] any longer?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.001.0003",
      "source_sha256": "c753158130ec8205",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And why will the soldier receive anything if he does not concern himself with what he has been assigned?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.001.0004",
      "source_sha256": "1b267210ea812582",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "In this way we are all exposed to danger and to judgment from God."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.001.0005",
      "source_sha256": "841068e84beed06f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 12,
      "text": "As for me, I do not make an effort to do what I ought to do."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.001.0006",
      "source_sha256": "a6381c10e5e91502",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 12,
      "text": "But as for these others, this is a way of death: even if regions are laid waste, they pursue their own business, namely plunder."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.001.0007",
      "source_sha256": "3c9b7b6f3238db0a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 12,
      "text": "For often, even if the soldier does his utmost and does not win, it is clear that God is the one who raises our enemies against us because of our sins."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.001.0008",
      "source_sha256": "f1cd4566562478ef",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 12,
      "text": "At other times, however, it is nothing but the negligence of those who govern, who fail to do what they ought to do."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.001.0009",
      "source_sha256": "173eb3c107e529f7",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 12,
      "text": "For the matter is clear when the authorities and the soldier risk their lives for those for whom they fight, knowing that the Lord is the one who gives strength and victory. But when they do not give their attention to the work, you will find them all the more readily at the time of plundering."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.001.0010",
      "source_sha256": "1cbe8a15b2ba79c1",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "You will find them again at the time of need."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.001.0011",
      "source_sha256": "c9281be137005a37",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "This has been their thinking since they came from distant regions and nearby ones: “We will not die because of other people.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.001.0012",
      "source_sha256": "de54f63c689cd10b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But they forget this, and it is not in their minds whether it is even lawful to take—for I will not say “plunder”—and to live in the houses of those against whom they are not fighting."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.001.0013",
      "source_sha256": "67893c70598016d5",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Or is there really no soldier ready to rob and plunder more than the barbarians?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.001.0014",
      "source_sha256": "7d4236d4b0ab4b90",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For the strength of each person throughout the earth is to rise up against someone [?] than himself."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.001.0015",
      "source_sha256": "7446a32153673c52",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But only one among many spares a weak person."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.001.0016",
      "source_sha256": "f6b42c609f453ed4",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "This is how it is: blessed is the person who has the power to do evil to his neighbor but does not do it."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.001.0017",
      "source_sha256": "3f7b6062b208be1c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For arrogance has gained power over everyone living in the world, from those who do not know God to those who say, “We know him better.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.001.0018",
      "source_sha256": "97cd8392aab53dd6",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Even the poor and women do this. Even wicked children mistreat their father who fathered them"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.001.0019",
      "source_sha256": "9c8288ea86885f93",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and their mother who raised them, and even one brother another brother,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.001.0020",
      "source_sha256": "dd3f8bfde70f20d8",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and even a brother his sister."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.001.0021",
      "source_sha256": "1276378e3bf1ccec",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And even foreigners and local inhabitants—these too envy one another."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.001.0022",
      "source_sha256": "5b96b555c3573f77",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Those who commit sin are many."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.001.0023",
      "source_sha256": "c44c4793f5c8f86d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Those who envy them are also many, learning from them and outdoing one another in violence."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.001.0024",
      "source_sha256": "4e339ec9fcaf43a3",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 12,
      "text": "What does the hunter do? He makes an effort to obtain an animal, or some animals, and places it around his nets and hunting equipment, until many gather and many come, and until they become [?] with one another in the trap."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.001.0025",
      "source_sha256": "3423248654b582be",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "A person does not see a demon committing a sin and then do it himself. Rather, it is a person seeing another person practicing ungodliness who then does it himself. What—what—"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.001.0026",
      "source_sha256": "754c1157d09a9b38",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "What, then, does the fisherman do? He looks for very small creatures that are appetizing and puts them on his hook until he catches choice fish."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.001.0027",
      "source_sha256": "07b82ab9906760ef",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "In the same way, and even more so, Satan looks for people who are pleasing to Jesus and binds them in his lawlessness until he draws very many people into evil."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.001.0028",
      "source_sha256": "e3f3b32de2402d5e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "This is how it is: woe to us, because each one has become a stumbling block to his neighbor."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.001.0029",
      "source_sha256": "37be53fe84eb13f2",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For someone says, “If I had not seen you plundering and committing violence, I would not have plundered or committed violence.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.001.0030",
      "source_sha256": "19a3cecbd609af58",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And, “If you had not practiced deceit in wickedness, I would not have practiced deceit.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.001.0031",
      "source_sha256": "6ecb8eca378bdd2d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And, “If you had not practiced deceit in every kind of evil, I would not have done these things.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.001.0032",
      "source_sha256": "6235f71fa0657bd2",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And, “Indeed, if you had not roared against the poor like these lions, I would not have roared.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.001.0033",
      "source_sha256": "44b3996145caddb3",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And if anyone is safe, it is Jesus who helped him and rescued him."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.001.0034",
      "source_sha256": "9c9ed0c4fd0814c6",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "A drunken person will not recognize someone who is drunk. For many evils exist under heaven before those who have sobered up from their wine, or those who have not been weighed down by that wine of which he speaks: “He is drunk with the wine of sinners,” and, “Those who are drunk without wine.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.001.0035",
      "source_sha256": "6b728b2eceeb3d62",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For do not the words of this voice cry out into the air: “If you see oppression being inflicted on a poor person in a region, and justice and righteousness being taken away,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.001.0036",
      "source_sha256": "ca59c4897b4ed799",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "do not be astonished at the matter.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.001.0037",
      "source_sha256": "8f379df00b5d3760",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And, “Look at the tears of those who are oppressed.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.001.0038",
      "source_sha256": "e22059bac7b5a5c4",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“There is no one to comfort them against those who oppress him with force—[?] the one who will comfort them.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.001.0039",
      "source_sha256": "2be47013a032aa7c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He also said in this same book,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.001.0040",
      "source_sha256": "dbd987159e3a4c32",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“The heart of human beings has agreed with them to do evil among them.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.001.0041",
      "source_sha256": "abd654dffc721b70",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And again, “The heart of human beings is filled with evil.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.001.0042",
      "source_sha256": "32c1f4f1ea076f10",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 12,
      "text": "The one who committed the sin also committed the evil deed."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.001.0043",
      "source_sha256": "665d0dba7e5b624b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "For this evil swelling in our hearts has made us unaware that we are members of one another and that we are God's offspring. We are not ashamed to oppress one another."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.001.0044",
      "source_sha256": "47cb7ea0f0f423ce",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "Nor do we fear the words of the prophets that fight against us:"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.001.0045",
      "source_sha256": "d500d426121c53cd",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "“Was it not one God who formed you?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.001.0046",
      "source_sha256": "6e770932a034fb44",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "Is it not one Father who is over us all? Why"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.001.0047",
      "source_sha256": "d146dd065039d3d1",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "does each one abandon his brother, defiling the covenant of your fathers?” And: “The Lord will wipe out the person who does these things.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.001.0048",
      "source_sha256": "6346dc4600813c19",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "For if I say that the devil [?] thinks up worse evil than the people who are in turmoil [?], so that you wonder, “Where do these people get the idea for these lawless acts?”—"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.001.0049",
      "source_sha256": "cfc56cce5439ad98",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "it is he who advises them and reveals these things to them as something great—as great mysteries. Otherwise, where would he exercise his power, or in what, except in these—in hearts that love evil?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.001.0050",
      "source_sha256": "ac906d91781b29d3",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "For he is powerless to act in the mountains, or the earth, or anything else."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.001.0051",
      "source_sha256": "98e9d4e261c3fa65",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "What is written in the Psalms about people who do not want to do what is right, and who also do not want to be excluded because of their acts of oppression?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.001.0052",
      "source_sha256": "4b3e15e11788a663",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "They want to enter God's places, but they do not want to put his words into practice. They said: “They will return in the evening and be hungry like dogs, and go around the city. If they are not satisfied, they will grumble.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.001.0053",
      "source_sha256": "f6dd649eb8b50ba2",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "Listen to “evening.” This means that they will return with their dark thinking and go around Christ's congregation. But if they are not admitted, they will say these words, grumbling and saying: “Let him bring us the Scriptures! For not only did he refuse to accept us, but he also refused to accept our wives and our children.” They are confident in their false knowledge that they will prevail with these words: “The son will not bear his father's wrongdoing.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.001.0054",
      "source_sha256": "a9040beb92f9245e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "And: “Forgive seventy times.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.001.0055",
      "source_sha256": "9dcde8aa5467c2af",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "As though no one but them knew that each person will die for his own sin!"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.001.0056",
      "source_sha256": "11e9d8f7f647eeb3",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "The occasion for speaking about these things is quite different from the occasion for what you are saying now."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.001.0057",
      "source_sha256": "9fa21a2fedb87abd",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "Let those who think this way say: Do they not enjoy, with their wives and children, the things stolen from the poor that are in their houses? Or do the things taken from people by force not cause those people grief, along with their wives and children?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.001.0058",
      "source_sha256": "7ebb0427cc7b4156",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "And why is it not right for us to cause you grief—you and those who share in your evil deeds?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.001.0059",
      "source_sha256": "c03be1dfeb078336",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "If I do not show you from the Scriptures and sweep away your arguments all at once, so that you understand that it is sometimes right for us to be distressed, then you may judge me"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.001.0060",
      "source_sha256": "1b8663d8fdc505fa",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "as you said: “He is a slave to the curse,” because I excluded you."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.001.0061",
      "source_sha256": "d8f6115e3288d57a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "Did Achan, son of Zerah, steal a possession from a poor person, or kill anyone? Just as you too said this: “Have we really killed anyone?”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.001.0062",
      "source_sha256": "2f8fe0e38a412468",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "Was it not a cloak and a bar of gold that he stole from the spoils of the enemies?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.001.0063",
      "source_sha256": "b78c73be22f00af0",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "Or was he not the only one who did evil?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_unknown5_1#CopScr.shenoute-unknown51.001.0064",
      "source_sha256": "453253082fac0796",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "Or do animals really sin? And"
    }
  ]
}
